└─│ ON EVERY TAB                                          ON SETTINGS                                               │──┘
┌P│ ↑/↓ j/k        select a row                           space               switch a gate or the lock             │──┐
│ │ ←/→ h/l 1 2 3  switch between the tabs                e                   edit the row in a form                │  │
│ │ r              refresh                                enter               switch or edit, as the row takes      │  │
│ │ esc            back to the dashboard                                                                            │  │
│ │ tab            next page                              ON SCHEDULE                                               │  │
│ │ q              quit                                   space               off, while awake, wake then ping      │  │
│ │                                                       n                   add a slot, as 07:20 Mon..Fri         │  │
│ │ ON PROVIDERS                                          e enter             edit the slot                         │  │
│ │ space          turn the provider on or off            d                   remove the slot                       │  │
│ │ e              enter its key, which is never shown    x                   stop waking with nothing to ping      │  │
└─│ u              set its endpoint                                                                                 │──┘
  │ f              codex: set the refresh url             IN A FORM                                                 │
  │ v              codex: pin a client version            enter ctrl+s        save, once nothing is refused         │
  │ p              codex: probe for the version, or not   esc                 cancel                                │
  │ c              clear its safeguards rejection marks                                                             │
  │ enter          open the first route that reaches it   MARKS                                                     │
  │                                                       none                on, with no credential to answer with │
  │                                                       not configured      the same, said in words               │
  │                                                       marked unsupported  a refusal marked the binding          │
  │                                                       built-in            unset: this is what it falls back to  │
  │                                                       follows lane TTL    unset: the lane's own cache tier      │
  │                                                       175k  1M  1.5M      token counts, in full or shorthand    │
